# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
artifacts/
cache/
metrics/
benchmark_report.json
backend/evaluation_output/
backend/evaluation_summary.md
backend/golden_update_report.md
frontend/public/events.json

# Repomix & Repo Exports
*repomix*.md
*repomix*.xml
project-tree.txt
repo_files.txt
